# Glass shell (CHANGE-GUI-WEBGL-SHELL)

- Live shell must match Botanical/Brutalist glass concepts using WebGL2/R3F/Three.js (and compatible effects) with accessible 2D fallback.
- Interactive text/controls stay semantic HTML; canvas is decorative atmosphere behind/around UI.
- Honor reduce-transparency, reduce-motion, and missing WebGL2 by disabling the canvas path without losing data.
- No VR/AR, navigable campus, ocean or free-roam world. Phase 12 aids remain separate instructional features.
- Owner visual acceptance is still pending after implementation.
